 "trol; EMCON silent means no active emissions) where possible to avoid giving away their presence, identity and location.": "管控；EMCON 静默意味着不进行任何主动辐射)尽可能避免暴露自身的存在、身份与位置。",
 "ESM detections can be made well beyond the maximum range of an emitting radar. Radar sends out radio energy and detects contacts based on their reflection of that energy, but an ESM set only needs to detect the radiated energy--the detected energy doesn't have to be powerful enough to send a reflection for the ESM set to know that there is a contact out there. This is a very important fundamental principle of modern naval and air warfare, and is the main reason why most aircraft and ships prefer to remain EMCON silent (EMCON stands for": "电子支援措施（ESM）的探测距离可以远远超出辐射源雷达的最大作用距离。雷达向外发射射频能量，并依据目标对该能量的反射回波来发现目标；而 ESM 设备只需探测到辐射出来的能量即可——并不要求该能量强到足以产生反射回波，ESM 设备就能判断该海域存在目标接触。这是现代海空作战中极为重要的一条基本原则，也是大多数飞机与舰艇宁愿保持 EMCON 静默的主要原因(EMCON 意为",
 "Press \"CTRL + SHIFT + F9\" to bring up the Side Doctrine, EMCON and WRA window, or you can select your aircraft and press \"CTRL + F9\" to bring up the Unit Doctrine, EMCON and WRA). The difference being changing side settings will affect all units on the side, whereas changing just the individual unit settings will affect only that unit.": "按「CTRL + SHIFT + F9」打开【阵营条令、辐射控制与武器投射权限】窗口；或先选中你的战机，再按「CTRL + F9」打开【单位条令、辐射控制与武器投射权限】窗口)。两者的区别在于：修改阵营设置会影响该阵营的全部单位，而只修改单个单位的设置仅影响该单位。",
 "Manually: Launch the Fencer, plot a course directly over or very close to the target base. Make sure there is a Waypoint in your course before and after the base with a straight run over the target. When you launch keep your Altitude around 12,000 ft to conserve fuel (not a requirement here but good practice). At the waypoint before the base set your speed to afterburner and your Altitude to about 500ft. At the waypoint after the base slow her down and bring your altitude back up.": "手动方式：起飞「击剑手」，规划一条正对或非常贴近目标基地的航线。务必在基地前后各设一个航路点，使航路以直线穿过目标。起飞后保持约 12,000 英尺高度以节省燃油（本课不作硬性要求，但属良好习惯）。在基地之前的航路点将速度设为加力、高度降至约 500 英尺。在基地之后的航路点减速并把高度拉回。",
 "Message Log and select 'Raise Pop-Up' for any event that you wish. Useful pop-ups for Surface operations include 'Contact Change', 'New Contact', 'Special Messages' (this should always be on), 'Unit Damage', 'Unit Lost' and 'New Weapon Contact'.": "消息日志，并对你关心的任何事件勾选「弹出提示」。水面作战中实用的弹出提示包括「接触变更」「新接触」「专用战情消息」（建议始终开启）、「单位受损」「单位损失」与「新武器接触」。",
 "Message Log settings and view the message log entries--note that since we are not defending against live missiles in this training exercise, decoys will not be deployed.": "消息日志设置，并查看消息日志条目——请注意，本次训练演习中我们并非抵御实弹导弹攻击，因此不会投放诱饵。",
 "Not an issue. Measure the distance between the base and the SA-5 (\"CTRL + D\" & click or select the base and watch the cursor data to see the range as you move the mouse (XXXnm from Sel). I read the SA-5 as 340nm, and the outer limit of the mission 2 box is about 320nm so put in a maximum strike radius of 320 halfway down the center column.": "这不是问题。测量基地与 SA-5 之间的距离（按「CTRL + D」并点击，或选中基地后移动鼠标，观察光标数据中的距离读数(距所选目标 XXX 海里）。我实测 SA-5 为 340 海里，而任务 2 方框的外缘约为 320 海里，因此在中间列的中部填入最大打击半径 320。",
 "Special Actions and then select the special action named 'Ready ASW Helicopter' and click 'execute'. The helicopter will then be immediately ready to take off and make another attack.": "特别行动，然后选择名为「准备反潜直升机」的特别行动并点击「执行」。该直升机随后将立即做好起飞准备，并可再次发起攻击。",
 "When you detect a suitable contact, launch a RHIB to identify it by opening the Docking Ops window (F7), selecting a RHIB and clicking 'Launch Individually'. Keep an eye on fuel consumption and range for your deployed RHIBs and helicopter. You can recall embarked units be selecting them and pressing 'B' (Return To": "当你发现合适的接触目标时，按 F7 打开【小艇作业】窗口，选择一艘硬壳充气艇（RHIB）并点击「单艇释放」以派其前往识别目标。请留意已派出的小艇与直升机的燃油消耗与航程。要召回搭载单位，可选中它们并按「B」(返回",
 "Select HMAS Stuart and order it to replenish from HMAS Sirius by using the right-click unit context menu and selecting 'UNREP if possible' > 'Select Provider Manually' and then clicking on HMAS Sirius": "选中「斯图尔特」号（HMAS Stuart），使用右键单位上下文菜单并选择「如有可能则进行海上补给 (UNREP) > 手动选择补给舰」，然后点击「天狼星」号（HMAS Sirius），命令其前往实施补给。",
